<title>JAPAN: M'bishi Chem down after earnings revision.</title>
<headline>M'bishi Chem down after earnings revision.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mitsubishi Chemical Corp's shares fell in mid-morning Monday trade, depressed by a downward revision in its earnings forecast, brokers said.</p>
<p>At 0104 GMT, the shares were down 14 yen at 468 yen on a turnover of 824,000.</p>
<p>The comprehensive chemical manufacturer said on Friday that it expected its parent current profit for the year to March 31, 1997, to be 3.00 billion yen, down from an original forecast of 23.00 billion yen.</p>
